          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "1",
          "title": "Build Part",
          "text": "1. Build Part\r\nParts are the building blocks of Wasp.\r\nThe most basic way of initializing a part is to define t he geometry (as brep or mesh),\r\nand the connection faces (center and orientation - with a line). Parts must be named\r\nto be identifyed in the aggregation rules.",
          "nearby_components": [
            "Wasp_Update File"
          ],
          "annotation_type": "Scribble",
          "pos": [
            29.7,
            114.1
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "2",
          "title": "Define aggregation rules",
          "text": "2. Define aggregation rules\r\nRules define which connection of which part can be\r\nconnected with each other to for the aggregation.\r\n\r\nNB: Rules are directional! So if you want to connect 1 to 2 and 2 to 1,\r\nyou need to write two separate rules.",
          "nearby_components": [
            "Curve",
            "NumberSlider",
            "NumberSlider",
            "Point",
            "NumberSlider",
            "Brep"
          ],
          "annotation_type": "Scribble",
          "pos": [
            180.1,
            579.2
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "3",
          "title": "Aggregate!",
          "text": "3. Aggregate!\r\nStochastic Aggregation builds an aggregation by randomly selecting one part\r\nand one rule to be applied at every step.\r\nThe component adds parts additively over the already aggregated parts.\r\nIf a new aggregation has to be created, the RESET button allows to reset\r\nthe aggregation and restart.",
          "nearby_components": [
            "PARTS_NUM",
            "Wasp_Basic Part"
          ],
          "annotation_type": "Scribble",
          "pos": [
            866.7,
            163.9
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "4",
          "title": "Visualize",
          "text": "4. Visualize\r\nIn order to visualize the result, it is necessary to extract\r\nthe part geometry from the part itself.",
          "nearby_components": [
            "Wasp_Get Part Geometry",
            "Swatch",
            "Custom Preview",
            "Wasp_Stochastic Aggregation"
          ],
          "annotation_type": "Scribble",
          "pos": [
